usage: rot ci [-h] [--policy FILE] [--max-inflight K] [--amount N] [--cap N]
              [--window W] [--kind {safety,realizability,liveness}]
              [--liveness-horizon H] [--out DIR]

optional arguments:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --policy FILE         policy file (.dw / .cedar / .json)
  --max-inflight K      bounded concurrency pool K (spend-cap .dw policies)
  --amount N            per-request amount override (spend-cap .dw policies)
  --cap N               spend cap override (spend-cap .dw policies)
  --window W            temporal window as a bounded event count W (spend-cap
                        .dw policies; the model is time-free so a 'within W'
                        is approximated as the last W events)
  --kind {safety,realizability,liveness}
                        property kind [default: auto-route by extension]
  --liveness-horizon H  bounded liveness horizon (liveness policies)
  --out DIR             artifact dir [default: ci]
